# OMi fitting library - git repo for Claude Code cloud sessions (2026-10-18).
# Goal: everything the Python side needs (tools, review tables, docs, Brennan STEPs, catalog parse, current staging), under ~100 MB.
# NOT included: SolidWorks parts (the cloud cannot run SolidWorks), old staging copies, _to_delete, _archive.

# --- SolidWorks files and lock files
*.SLDPRT
*.SLDDRW
*.SLDASM
*.sldprt
*.slddrw
~$*
11_MASTERS/
11_MASTERS_NEW/

# --- history / scratch
_to_delete/
_archive/
Claude outputs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- drawings: keep the OMi correspondence, drop the big PDFs
10_DRAWINGS/**/*.pdf
10_DRAWINGS/**/*.png

# --- tools/_out: ignore all, then re-include the current work
